<title>USA: Mine Safety raises qtly div to $0.31-shr.</title>
<headline>Mine Safety raises qtly div to $0.31-shr.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mine Safety Appliances Co said its board declared a first-quarter dividend of $0.31 on each share of its common stock, payable March 10 to shareholders of record February 21.</p>
<p>The previously quarterly dividend was $0.28 per share.</p>
<p>The board also declared a dividend of $0.5625 per share of its preferred stock, payable March 1 to shareholders of record February 14.</p>
</text>
